        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yahya Al Bishri, Abdullah of Saudi Arabia, Princess Diana\n- Roles: Saudi fashion designer, King of Saudi Arabia, Custodian of the Two Holy Mosques\n- Topics: Fashion design, royal families\n\nFacts:\n- Abdullah of Saudi Arabia was born on 1 August 1924 and died on 23 January 2015.\n- Yahya Al Bishri is a Saudi fashion designer.\n- Abdullah of Saudi Arabia served as King of Saudi Arabia and Custodian of the Two Holy Mosques from 2005 until his death in 2015.\n- Yahya Al Bishri designed garments for Abdullah of Saudi Arabia.\n- Yahya Al Bishri designed garments for royal families around the world, including Princess Diana.",
